//
//   prompt.*  every prompt fixture through prompt.submit (pane session) and session.receive
//             (inert session), as the [key, value] pairs the store was given, in order
//   bash.*    every send.sh fixture through the Bash tool.call, the same way
//   board.*   project() for the worlds the s1, s2 and s2b suites build, with each PR shown as
//             `owner/name#n`; work.* and prs.* are those boards drawn, one line per row
//   kit.*     two main sessions under kit stubs, drawn through the real ui.render hook
//
// The literals were printed by this file against 3869ee2. A value changes only in a commit that
// says which plan item calls the old value a bug.
//
// THV-1061 (S4) re-printed 39 board.* and kit.*.facts literals; no work.* or prs.* text moved.
// Health gains `linear`. Every row gains a `started` event and each open or merged PR a `pr` event
// (spec "Linear" row: started, pr N, report STATUS, merged N). Merged ids carry the repo,
// `merged-<owner/name>-<n>`, so FE #138 and BE #138 are two events (the THV-1061 ruling).
//
// THV-1102 re-printed prs.s2b.prose-139: agent-skills #10's CI reads – where it read ✓, because its
// only checks are Cursor's two NEUTRAL bot checks and no CI ran (THV-1101 item 5).

